# mc-notebook self-test for the Android smoke run (packaging/android/smoke.sh): the start screen, a new calculation,
# an input evaluated with the kernel, then a plot. @OUT@ is replaced by the folder on the device where the log and
# the screenshots go.
out @OUT@
theme light
wait 30
shot start
calc
wait 10
formula smoke/integral
keys "integrate(x^2 sin(x), x)"
shot typed
eval
expect output "2*cos(x) - cos(x)*x^2 + 2*x*sin(x)"
formula smoke/plot
keys Ctrl+End "plot(sin(x), [x, 0, 6])"
eval
wait 30
shot evaluated
log finished
quit
